id: pitch-black
name: Pitch Black
kind: battlefield
lightLevel: -2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  You cannot see. Halve your Awareness, Defense Value and Perception Skill Bonus.
text: >
  * Pitch Black (-2). Halve your Awareness, Defense Value, and the Skill Bonus for
  your Perception Skill.

---

# The far end of the dark half, and the same three values the Blinding Light Level takes
# at the far end of the bright one. Too much light and too little come to exactly the same
# numbers, which is the shape of the whole table rather than a coincidence: it is
# symmetrical about Normal.
#
# Halved rather than reduced, which is the difference between this and Dark. A halving
# lands on the finished value - "when an effect multiplies or divides a value, that is
# applied after all other modifications to said value" - so this halves whatever the rest
# of the character came to, not some part of it.

[passive]
awareness *= 0.5;
defenseValue *= 0.5;
skill.perception.bonus *= 0.5;
